      "content": "Hey, can you give me a quick breakdown of the stages for our new CI/CD pipeline? We're looking at Code Commit, Automated Testing, Staging, and finally Production Deployment. Can you include what kind of gates or checkpoints we should have at each stage to make sure nothing breaks? Thanks.",
